# Dispatch: "Tap target creature. Metalcraft — If you control three or more artifacts, exile that creature" (CR
# 701.26a, 608.2c). Bot1 controls two Moxen, one short of metalcraft, and casts it on Bot2's Elite Vanguard on turn 3:
# the Vanguard is tapped and stays on the battlefield. With three Moxen the same cast exiles it instead
# (dispatch-with-metalcraft-exiles-the-creature-it-tapped).

